    "description": {
      "value": "<p>&Reference[hide]{Hide}</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><strong>midi-qol</strong>: A DC 15 Stealth check; on a success you are Hidden (Invisible) and your total is the DC to find you. Hidden ends when you make an attack roll, cast a spell with a Verbal component, or are found (Search). With CPR installed its hide macro applies the effect (Supreme Sneak, animation); midi records the DC for any activity using CPR's hide.</p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
